scription": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1yeAZ0DUuYQ7kNvwHl0hmz&_nc_oc=Adl14IbMtBX4ro4wKfsN_6N4r2qrN18-sJ1Sf9vSTVSpcLyzaEdEVCyCnxFBfm7T7Ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfselR-MB6wSpYmbf0TlhtLXB03EJH1_g--VPmQnXQnzIA&oe=69A2F389"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MgB8niQpiO4Q7kNvwH0Z23F&_nc_oc=Adkz2yoHDSFW3XiRt87TMQxACXuiunFuxzbW2BLD2j18MWjYOPoVud0N13NsASgRJIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsNVvhORLwiFVOra11qMeKnyCEcFdi6GsRCz89PKEWpOw&oe=69A2F1BD"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CaF0I7Zpl6oQ7kNvwHNUk9b&_nc_oc=AdlJ08lKjeZE4RSVXghj-3ckNuqcXFoktjwMVJy_kYRY_pPQH1rAiXwwzuAvPOsN